/// \defgroup grp_network Network
/// \brief Lockstep multiplayer, the LAN lobby and the online services.
///
/// `NetworkInterface` (`TheNetwork`) and the frame-admission queries;
/// `ConnectionManager`, `Connection`, `NetPacket` and the `NetCommandMsg`
/// family that carry player commands; the per-player frame rings;
/// `Transport` and `UDP` over Winsock; `DisconnectManager`; the LAN lobby
/// `LANAPI` with `GameInfo` and `GameSlot`; and the GameSpy and FESL
/// online code. \ref sub_network describes the subsystem, its state and
/// its differences from Zero Hour.
